38-song:p027","quote":"武公生女爲魯惠公夫人，生魯桓公。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-shiji038-035:a001","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p027","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"夫人","person_mention_id":"c-shiji-038-song:m027-0024","usage":"narrative"}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"source_event","event_type":"grant","date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p027","quote":"武公生女爲魯惠公夫人，生魯桓公。"}]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"生女為魯惠公夫人的明示婚姻角色；不由武公立或卒日定授予日期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[{"id":"d-shiji038-065","person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","surfaces":["夫人"],"scope":"same_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-038-song"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p027","quote":"三十四年，戴公卒，子武公司空立。武公生女爲魯惠公夫人，生魯桓公。十八年，武公卒，子宣公力立。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、宋國世系及具體事件暫同指；未把同字短名全域合併，所有引句與未定處保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"identity_distinctions":[{"id":"d-shiji038-distinct-007","person_ids":["2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","b2s_jfq_0ra"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p027","quote":"三十四年，戴公卒，子武公司空立。武公生女爲魯惠公夫人，生魯桓公。十八年，武公卒，子宣公力立。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-038","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-038-song:p035","quote":"桓公二年，諸矦伐宋，至郊而去。三年，齊桓公始霸。二十三年，迎衛公子燬於齊，立之，是爲衛文公。文公女弟爲桓公夫人。秦穆公即位。三十年，桓公病，太子茲甫讓其庶兄目夷爲嗣。桓公義太子意，竟不聽。三十一年春，桓公卒，太子茲甫立，是爲襄公。以其庶兄目夷爲相。未葬，而齊桓公會諸矦于葵丘，襄公往會。","chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-038","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"}],"rationale":"宋武公女嫁魯惠公與衛文公女弟為宋桓公夫人不同國別婚姻角色。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p001","text":"殷淑儀，南郡王義宣女也。麗色巧笑。義宣敗後，帝密取之，寵冠後宮。假姓殷氏，左右宣洩者多死，故當時莫知所出。及薨，帝常思見之，遂為通替棺，欲見輒引替睹屍，如此積日，形色不異。追贈貴妃，諡曰宣。及葬，給轀輬車、虎賁、班劍。鑾輅九旒、黃屋左纛、前後部羽葆、鼓吹，上自于南掖門臨，過喪車，悲不自勝，左右莫不掩泣。上痛愛不已，精神罔罔，頗廢政事。每寢，先於靈床酌奠酒飲之，既而慟哭不能自反。又諷有司奏曰：「據春秋，仲子非魯惠西元嫡，尚得考別宮。今貴妃蓋天秩之崇班，理應創新。」乃立別廟於都下。","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p001:m0000","surface":"殷淑儀","start":0,"end":3,"person_id":"954_d3c_24e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p001:m0007","surface":"義宣","start":7,"end":9,"person_id":"9df_923_1a1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p001:m0017","surface":"義宣","start":17,"end":19,"person_id":"9df_923_1a1","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanshi-011-yinshuyi:p001:m0202","surface":"仲子","start":202,"end":204,"person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2288359,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":60,"last_line":60,"line_start":0,"line_end":241,"raw_start":3892,"raw_end":4133,"raw_character_offsets":[3892,3893,3894,3895,3896,3897,3898,3899,3900,3901,3902,3903,3904,3905,3906,3907,3908,3909,3910,3911,3912,3913,3914,3915,3916,3917,3918,3919,3920,3921,3922,3923,3924,3925,3926,3927,3928,3929,3930,3931,3932,3933,3934,3935,3936,3937,3938,3939,3940,3941,3942,3943,3944,3945,3946,3947,3948,3949,3950,3951,3952,3953,3954,3955,3956,3957,3958,3959,3960,3961,3962,3963,3964,3965,3966,3967,3968,3969,3970,3971,3972,3973,3974,3975,3976,3977,3978,3979,3980,3981,3982,3983,3984,3985,3986,3987,3988,3989,3990,3991,3992,3993,3994,3995,3996,3997,3998,3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023,4024,4025,4026,4027,4028,4029,4030,4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,