":"泛稱、政制、群體、神異、匿名者或未定指代；不補未見人名、闕代、制度爵等或成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m035-0138","start":138,"end":140,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"l3c_zg4_f7z","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-038-song","book_id":"b-shiji-038","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-038-song"},{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001","text":"大明七年正月庚子，有司奏：「故宣貴妃加殊禮，未詳應立廟與不？」太學博士虞龢議：「曲禮云：『天子有后，有夫人。』檀弓云：『舜葬蒼梧，三妃未之從。』昏義云：『后之立六宮，有三夫人。』然則三妃即三夫人也。后之有三妃，猶天子之有三公也。按周禮，三公八命，諸侯七命。三公既尊於列國諸侯，三妃亦貴於庶邦夫人。據春秋傳，仲子非魯惠元嫡，尚得考彼別宮。今貴妃是秩，天之崇班，理應立此新廟。」左丞徐爰議：「宣貴妃既加殊命，禮絕五宮，考之古典，顯有成據。廟堂克構，宜選將作大匠。」參詳以龢、爰議為允。詔可。","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0035","surface":"虞龢","start":35,"end":37,"person_id":"i7o_va4_pbj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0153","surface":"仲子","start":153,"end":155,"person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0189","surface":"徐爰","start":189,"end":191,"person_id":"rq3_n56_efd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0233","surface":"龢","start":233,"end":234,"person_id":"i7o_va4_pbj","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-017-yinshuyi-temple:p001:m0235","surface":"爰","start":235,"end":236,"person_id":"rq3_n56_efd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1748380,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":59,"last_line":59,"line_start":0,"line_end":243,"raw_start":9735,"raw_end":9978,"raw_character_offsets":[9735,9736,9737,9738,9739,9740,9741,9742,9743,9744,9745,9746,9747,9748,9749,9750,9751,9752,9753,9754,9755,9756,9757,9758,9759,9760,9761,976