f":"8上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":4,"text":"考彼別宮"}]},"chapter_id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd","book_id":"b-songshu-080","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-080-yinshuyi-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p004","text":"又諷有司曰：「典禮云，天子有后，有夫人。檀弓云，舜葬蒼梧，三妃不從。昏義云，后立六宮，有三夫人。然則三妃則三夫人也。后之有三妃，猶天子之有三公也。按周禮，三公八命，諸侯七命。三公既尊於列國諸侯，三妃亦貴於庶邦夫人。據春秋傳，仲子非魯惠公之元嫡，尚得考彼別宮；今貴妃蓋天秩之崇班，理應創立新廟。」尚書左丞徐爰之又議：「宣貴妃既加殊命，禮絕五宮，考之古典，顯有成據。廟堂克構，宜選將作大匠卿。」","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p004:m0112","surface":"仲子","start":112,"end":114,"person_id":"2v6_0g1_ve2_AAAAAAAAAA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-songshu-080-yinshuyi-ziluan:p004:m0151","surface":"徐爰","start":151,"end":153,"person_id":"rq3_n56_efd","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":2261200,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":59,"last_line":59,"line_start":0,"line_end":260,"raw_start":3868,"raw_end":4128,"raw_character_offsets":[3868,3869,3870,3871,3872,3873,3903,3904,3905,3906,3907,3908,3909,3910,3911,3912,3913,3914,3915,3916,3917,3918,3919,3920,3921,3922,3923,3924,3925,3926,3927,3928,3929,3930,3967,3968,3969,3970,3971,3972,3973,3974,3975,3976,3977,3978,3979,3980,3981,3982,3983,3984,3985,3986,3987,3988,3989,3990,3991,3992,3993,3994,3995,3996,3997,3998,3999,4000,4001,4002,4003,4004,4005,4006,4007,4008,4009,4010,4011,4012,4013,4014,4015,4016,4017,4018,4019,4020,4021,4022,4023,4024,4025,4026,4027,4028,4029,4030,4031,4032,4033,4034,4035,4036,4037,4038,4039,4040,4041,4042,4043,4044,4045,4046,4047,4048,4049,4050,4051,4052,4053,4054,4055,4056,4057,4058,4059,4060,4061,4062,4063,4064,4065,4066,4067,4068,4069,4070,4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4082,4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,4088,4089,4090,4091,4092,4093,4094,4095,4096,4097,4098,4099,4100,4101,4102,4103,4104,4105,4106,4107,